Your response will be priced at the same rate as the routed model. The cost_tier setting (low, medium, high, xhigh, or max) selects how much you're willing to pay. The default is low, giving you a highly cost-efficient set of models. When selecting models, the auto router respects any guardrails, privacy/ZDR policies, and model restrictions you have in the request or account settings. Multi-turn conversations stick to one model until it is no longer a leading choice for your task.
...
